Author: Dr. Thorsten Tepper Garcia

Created: 08 FEB 2021

	Last modified:


About:

This subdirectory contains a number of patches
to files originally in patch/init/dice, unless stated otherwise.
The files are either files with custom modifications to improve DICE (for my needs), or those files originally in patch/init/dice that overlap with my patched files in patch/tepper/[amr/hydro/pm/poisson].

Note that the above determines the way the patches should be included in a Makefile that wishes to compile the DICE patch namely 1) my dice patch; 2) the original dice patch, 3) my other patches [amr/hydro/pm/poisson], although 2 and 3 are intercheanchable.

Notes:
	- The bck_21DEC023 folder is temporary until I've made sure that the most recent update (22 DEC 2023) is working


Modified files

init_flow_fine.f90:
- multiply IG_metal by ic_scale_metal to have freedom in the adopted units

init_part.f90:
- added 'use pm_parameters, only: sink_restart'
- added TRIM(output_dir) to filename strings where relevant
- split all if-clauses of the form:
  if(star.or.sink)then
	if(metal)then
	endif
  endif
into
  if(star.or.sink)then
  endif
  if(metal)then
  endif


particle_tree.f90:
- split all if-clauses of the form:
  if(star.or.sink)then
	if(metal)then
	endif
  endif
into
  if(star.or.sink)then
  endif
  if(metal)then
  endif


add_list.f90:
- split all if-clauses of the form:
  if(star.or.sink)then
	if(metal)then
	endif
  endif
into
  if(star.or.sink)then
  endif
  if(metal)then


read_params.f90:
- added variable 'output_dir' to namelist block 'output_params'
- added TRIM(output_dir) to filename strings where relevant
- added variable 'print_when_io' to namelist block 'run_params'
